--

LOCK TABLES `T_CK_COMPONENT_GUIDE` WRITE;
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `T_CK_COMPONENT_GUIDE` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `T_CK_COMPONENT_GUIDE` VALUES ('1','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.co.jobs.list','When a job is submitted, it is locked and its fields cannot be edited. If there are errors associated with the submitted job, it has to be cancelled before it is picked up for processing by the authorized party (aka Freight Forwarder)',NULL,'A','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS'),('10','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.list.table','Active DO claim jobs that you are processing',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('11','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details','Please update all the information to ensure correct information about the job is captured. Please notethat once the job has been confirmed, BLs cannot be edited or removed from the list.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('12','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table','Click on the eye icon to view the BL document. Click on the trash bin to remove BL from the list.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('13','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.attachments','Documents associated with all the BL are captured in the list.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('14','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.attachments.table','Click on the Download icon to download the respective documents. Power of Authority, Letter of Assignment  and Container Loan Application documents are automatically generated by the system.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('15','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.task.details','Once the list of DOs are confirmed clicked on the Submit button to retrieve the DO documents from the shipping line.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('16','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.task.details.table.main','Click on the Eye icon to view the task details on the section below. Click the Pencil icon to edit the task and Trash Bin to remove the task.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('17','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.task.details.table.sub','Click on the Trash Bin to remove DO from the task that are in NEW status. Click on Eye icon to view the DO details.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('18','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.query','Ensure that there are no outstanding queries by the Shipping Line. Document can be manually and temporarily added when there is an outstanding query.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('19','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.query.table','Click on the Response icon to response to the query after you have made the necessary changes requested by the Shipping Line. Click on the Eye icon to view the query made by the Shipping Line and the response to the query.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('2','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.co.jobs.list.table','Each job record in the list corresponds to job corresponding to a Bill of Lading (BL) document. These jobs when submitted will be picked up by the Authorized Party (aka Freight Forwarders) stated in the job for DO claiming. Click on eye icon to view the BL in PDF and the cancel icon to cancel the job.',NULL,'A','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS'),('20','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.audit','The audited even associated with the job is presented here. Filtering is supported to sniff out audit records by criteria(s).',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('21','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.claim.jobs.list','To view any of your jobs without editing, click on the Eye button. To edit any draft jobs, click on the Pencil button. To delete any draf jobs, click on the Trash Bin button.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('22','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.claim.jobs.list.table','Click on the Document icon to perform document verification. Click on the Money icon to perform payment verification.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('23','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.claim.jobs.tab.docverify.details','The charges amount will be shown once the job is submitted and verified. The proforma invoices are also available for download when the job details and documents are verified. Once payment is made, DO claim tasks ca be started to claim the DO under the BLs.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('24','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.task-details.task-listing.table','Click on the EYE icon to view the task details on the section below. Click the PENCIL icon to edit the task and TRASH BIN icon to remove the task.','','A','2022-11-28 07:40:48','SYS','2022-11-28 07:40:48','SYS'),('25','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.task-details.doi-listing.table','Click on the TRASH BIN to remove DO from the task that are in NEW status. Click on EYE icon to view the DO details.','','A','2022-11-28 07:40:48','SYS','2022-11-28 07:40:48','SYS'),('26','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.task-details.footer.info','Once the list of DO are confirmed click on the Submit button to retrive the DO documents from the shipping line.','','A','2022-11-28 07:40:48','SYS','2022-11-28 07:40:48','SYS'),('27','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details.new','The charges amount will be shown once the job is submitted and verified. The proforma invoices are also available for download when the job details and documents are verified. Once payment is made, DO claim tasks can be started to claim the DO under the BLs.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('28','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table.new','Click on the eye icon to view the BL document. BL documents cannot be removed because the job is confirmed.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('29','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details.submittted','Once payment is made, DO claim tasks can be started to claim the DO under the BLs.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('3','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.co.jobs.tabs.details','Update all the information to ensure correct information about the job is captured. Click Save to save the updated job or click Submit to submit the job to the Authorized Party.',NULL,'A','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS'),('30','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table.submitted','Click on the Eye icon to view the BL document. Click the Download icon to download the proforma invoice.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('31','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details.paid','Once payment is verified, DO claim tasks can be started to claim the DO under the BLs.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('32','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table.paid','Click on the eye icon to view the BL document. Click the Download icon to download the proforma invoice.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('33','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details.verified','Tasks can be started to claim the DO(s) associated with the BL in the list.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('34','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table.verified','Click on the eye icon to view the BL document. Click the download icon to download the proforma invoice.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('35','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details.completed','Tasks can be started to claim the DO(s) associated with the BL in the list.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('36','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table.completed','Click on the eye icon to view the BL document. Click the download icon to download the proforma invoice.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('37','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.payment.active.job.listing.table','Select at least one job and click the Pay icon for payment. Click the Magnifier icon to view list of DO.',NULL,'A','2023-02-01 00:00:00','SYS','2023-02-01 00:00:00','SYS'),('38','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.payment.history.listing.table','Click the Eye icon to view Payment Details.',NULL,'A','2023-02-01 00:00:00','SYS','2023-02-01 00:00:00','SYS'),('39','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.payment.details.table','For active payment, click the Arrow Submit icon to Pay. Click the Download icon to view the invoice.',NULL,'A','2023-02-01 00:00:00','SYS','2023-02-01 00:00:00','SYS'),('4','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.co.jobs.tabs.authorisation','Document will be reviewed by shipping line. If there are concerns, the owner of the job will be contacted via email for clarifications. Only after the documents and payment are verified will your Authorized Party be able to download the invoice and start the DO claim process.',NULL,'A','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS'),('41','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.claim.jobs.tabs.query','Create a query to inform the responder on the changes or correct documents required on what has been claimed.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('42','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.claim.jobs.tabs.query.table','Click on the EYE icon to view the query made by the Shipping Line and the response to the query. Click on the TRASH BIN to delete the query.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('43','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.pay.verify.list','Once submitted task has been submitted, the DOs listed within the tasks cannot be updated or removed. The shipping line will proceed to review the letter of authorisation documents, the DO charges will only be shown when the documents have been verified. The DO document and Invoice will only be made available for download once payment has been made and verified by the shipping line.',NULL,'A','2022-12-22 11:00:00','SYS','2022-12-22 11:00:00','SYS'),('44','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.sl.doc.verify.list','Once submitted task has been submitted, the DOs listed within the tasks cannot be updated or removed. The shipping line will proceed to review the letter of authorisation documents, the DO charges will only be shown when the documents have been verified. The DO document and Invoice will only be made available for download once payment has been made and verified by the shipping line.',NULL,'A','2022-12-22 11:00:00','SYS','2022-12-22 11:00:00','SYS'),('45','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.job-payment.job-listing.table','Once payment is made and verified, job status will be updated to \"PAYMENT VERIFIED\", and  it will be updated to PAID when the actual payment is received.',NULL,'A','2022-12-23 03:24:43','SYS','2022-12-23 03:24:43','SYS'),('5','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.co.jobs.tabs.authorisation.table','Except Bill of Lading, the authorisation document is generated and digital stamped. Click on Download to view the document in PDF format.',NULL,'A','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS'),('50','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.details.confirmed','Once payment is made, DO claim tasks can be started to claim the DO under the BLs.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('51','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.tabs.detaills.table.confirmed','Click on the Eye icon to view the BL document.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('6','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.co.jobs.tabs.audit','The audited even associated with the job is presented here. Filtering is supported to sniff out audit records by criteria(s).',NULL,'A','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS','2022-11-15 06:46:03','SYS'),('60','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.extension.jobs.list','To view any of your jobs without editing, click on the EYE button. To edit any draft jobs, click on the PENCIL button. To delete any draft jobs, click on the TRASH BIN button.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('7','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.bl.list','To view any of the Bill of Ladings, click on the DOWNLOAD button. To reject ony Bill of Ladings, click on the REJECT button.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('8','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.bl.list.table','Each job recordi n the list corresponds to a Bill of Lading (BL) document submitted by the Authorizer Party (aka Cargo Owners) for DO claiming. Click on eye icon to view the BL in PDF and then cancel icon to reject the BL.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS'),('9','CK','CLICDO','clicdo.doi.ff.claim.jobs.list','To view any of your jobs without editing, click on the EYE button. To edit any draft jobs, click on the PENCIL button. To delete any draft jobs, click on the TRASH BIN button.',NULL,'A','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS','2022-11-16 09:13:41','SYS');
